  "title": "Max & Min — descending f64",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Max & Min — descending f64",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Max/Min conserve les types exacts et publient les deux sorties de la même activation. Le profil authored v2 ignore un seul NaN; le profil explicite historique exact.v1 reste séparé.\nEntrées : x (f64) = 7; y (f64) = 2.\nRésultats attendus : max (f64) = 7; min (f64) = 2.\n\nCompatible comparable x,y -> max/min of the common type.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-max (f64) = 7\noutput-min (f64) = 2\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
